mount_core-1.3.0/lib/puppet/...   the release openvox 8.34.0 vendors
mount_core-2.1.0/lib/puppet/...   the release SIMP pins; differs from 1.3.0 only
                                  in Ruby 3.1 hash shorthand in the two files
                                  puppet/type/mount.rb and
                                  puppet/provider/mount/parsed.rb
Each holds puppet/type/mount.rb, puppet/provider/mount/parsed.rb and
puppet/provider/mount.rb.

Do not edit: TestFixturesMatchManifest requires each file's sha256 to equal the
digest in ../manifest.go.
